<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Photronics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Photronics started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of Photronics Inc as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- expects Photronics to earn $1.90 a share in 1997 and $2.45 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- expects revenue growth in 1997 and 1998 to exceed 20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Photronics gained 1-1/2 to 32-1/4.</p>
</text>
